Modifications: MarsRover frame choices, conservative acceleration, footprint/inflation
defaults; runtime environment overrides and namespace resolution are implemented
separately in tianrover/config.py and tianrover/launching.py.

urdf/mars.urdf is the model deployed on the user's NX at 192.168.1.42,
retrieved 2026-10-07. Meshes are provided by the existing tianbot_description
underlay. The new package does not modify that underlay model.
